#: ../../scientific-python-lectures/advanced/mathematical_optimization/index.rst:166
msgid "Getting started: 1D optimization"
msgstr "入門: 1 次元最適化"

#: ../../scientific-python-lectures/advanced/mathematical_optimization/index.rst:168
